      "content": "Thanks, these are a solid start. \n\nI just ran them through our internal tracker and the score came back a bit lower than I'd like. It's flagging that we aren't hitting the required keyword density for our core values. I know I said it's just a proxy, but if the score is too low, the HR director is going to reject the whole set before any human even reads them.\n\nCan you refine these? I really need the questions to be high-quality, but let's make sure we're actually hitting those specific terms—innovative, teamwork, synergy, growth-mindset, and collaboration—more consistently so the automated check passes. Try to work them in more naturally if you can, but we need to see those words.",
