      "content": "I understand the immediate need to satisfy the automated tracking system while maintaining question quality. Here are five revised questions that integrate your core value keywords more strategically.\n\n\"Describe a situation where your team needed to exhibit serious **collaboration** to overcome a major roadblock; how did your approach foster that **teamwork**?\"\n\n\"Can you share an experience where adopting an **innovative** approach required a **growth-mindset** to learn a completely new process?\"\n\n\"Tell me about a complex assignment that demanded departmental **synergy**; how did you initiate **collaboration** to bring disparate ideas into one shared vision?\"\n\n\"When faced with a failure, how do you demonstrate a **growth-mindset**, and what steps do you take to pivot in an **innovative** way?\"\n\n\"Give an example where exceptional **teamwork** led to a breakthrough, highlighting how successful **collaboration** created real business **synergy**.\"",
